stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Empty
    Empty --> FormEditing: User enters values
    FormEditing --> ValidationBlocked: Required/email validation fails
    ValidationBlocked --> FormEditing: User corrects values
    FormEditing --> ContactAdded: Submit valid form
    ContactAdded --> FormEditing: Form reset
    ContactAdded --> ContactVisible: Context consumer rerenders
    ContactVisible --> FormEditing: Add another contact
    ContactVisible --> [*]: Page reload clears in-memory state
